      "body": "# SkylineWebcams\r\n\r\nSkylineWebcams is the global leader in real-time high-definition video streaming, operating a proprietary network of thousands of live webcams deployed across major destinations worldwide. This document provides structured access to our exclusive live feeds, categorized by region, country, and points of interest.\r\n\r\n## Main Content\r\n\r\n- [Live Cams Overview](https://www.skylinewebcams.com/) - Main portal to access our global network of thousands of proprietary live FullHD cameras.\r\n- [Top Live Cams](https://www.skylinewebcams.com/en/top-live-cams.html) - Real-time streams with the highest global viewer counts.\r\n- [New Live Cams](https://www.skylinewebcams.com/en/new-livecams.html) - The latest proprietary webcams recently integrated into the network.\r\n\r\n## Popular Webcams\r\n\r\n- [New York - Times Square](https://www.skylinewebcams.com/en/webcam/united-states/new-york/new-york/times-square.html) - Live view of the heart of Manhattan.\r\n- [Venice - Rialto Bridge](https://www.skylinewebcams.com/en/webcam/italia/veneto/venezia/rialto-canal-grande.html) - View over the Grand Canal in Venice.\r\n- [Rome - Colosseum](https://www.skylinewebcams.com/en/webcam/italia/lazio/roma/roma-colosseo.html) - View of the Colosseum and the ruins of the Ludus Magnus (gladiator school).\r\n- [Rome - Piazza di Spagna](https://www.skylinewebcams.com/en/webcam/italia/lazio/roma/piazza-di-spagna.html) - Real-time feed of the Spanish Steps and Barcaccia Fountain.\r\n- [Milan Cathedral](https://www.skylinewebcams.com/en/webcam/italia/lombardia/milano/duomo-milano.html) - Panoramic view of the Piazza del Duomo.\r\n- [Skyline of Shanghai](https://www.skylinewebcams.com/en/webcam/china/shanghai/shanghai/skyline-of-shanghai.html) - Panoramic view of Shanghai with Lujiazui, Shanghai Tower, Shanghai World Financial Center and Jin Mao Tower.\r\n- [Mount Etna Eruptions](https://www.skylinewebcams.com/en/webcam/italia/sicilia/catania/vulcano-etna.html) - Live eruptions from Volcano Etna.\r\n- [Jerusalem - Western Wall](https://www.skylinewebcams.com/en/webcam/israel/jerusalem-district/jerusalem/western-wall.html) - View over the Western Wall and Temple Mount.\r\n- [Petra - The Treasury](https://www.skylinewebcams.com/en/webcam/jordan/maan/amman/petra-the-treasury.html) - View over the ancient temple of Al-Khazneh in Petra.\r\n\r\n## Main Webcam Categories\r\n\r\n- [City Webcams](https://www.skylinewebcams.com/en/live-cams-category/city-cams.html): City centers, squares and urban landmarks.\r\n- [Beach Webcams](https://www.skylinewebcams.com/en/live-cams-category/beach-cams.html): Beaches and coastal tourist destinations.\r\n- [Landscape Webcams](https://www.skylinewebcams.com/en/live-cams-category/nature-mountain-cams.html): Natural landscapes, mountains and lakes.\r\n- [Volcano Webcams](https://www.skylinewebcams.com/en/live-cams-category/volcanoes-cams.html): Live volcano views including Mount Etna and Stromboli.\r\n- [Ski Webcams](https://www.skylinewebcams.com/en/live-cams-category/ski-cams.html): Ski resorts and mountain slopes.\r\n- [Animal Webcams](https://www.skylinewebcams.com/en/live-cams-category/animals-cams.html): Wildlife and animal live streams.\r\n- [UNESCO Webcams](https://www.skylinewebcams.com/en/live-cams-category/unesco-cams.html): UNESCO World Heritage locations.\r\n\r\n\r\n## Additional Features & Support\r\n\r\n- [Get your Cam](https://www.skylinewebcams.com/en/get-live-cam.html) - Information for businesses or entities wanting to host a webcam on our proprietary platform.\r\n- [Construction Time-Lapse](https://www.skylinewebcams.com/en/constructions.html) - Services for tracking building and infrastructure progress.\r\n- [Premium Membership](https://www.skylinewebcams.com/en/premium.html) - High-quality features and ad-free experience for subscribed users.\r\n- [FAQs](https://www.skylinewebcams.com/en/support/faq.html) - Usage conditions and technical support.",
